{
    "title": "Jigsaw Puzzles - Puzzle Games",
    "description": "Get an engaging jigsaw puzzle experience with one of the world\u2019s most-downloaded puzzle games from a top developer!\r\n\r\nJigsaw Puzzles is an addictive, easy to play game with over 13,000 FREE cute HD pictures. No points, no gimmicks, and no missing pieces, simply enjoy hours of fun putting jigsaw puzzles together to calm down and relax.\r\n\r\nCreated by game experts and played by millions of puzzle lovers worldwide, Jigsaw Puzzles helps you exercise your short-term memory and concentration, while passing the time with real jigsaw puzzles and without taking up as much room.\r\n\r\nIndulge yourself and plunge into the wonderful world of HD jigsaw puzzle games! Enjoy piecing new bright magic jigsaw puzzles together every day!\r\n\r\nOur free puzzle game for adults includes a large number of beautiful images of different difficulty puzzles from easy to hard. The game difficulty is based on the number of jigsaw puzzle pieces, which should be put together.\r\n\r\nA free jigsaw puzzle app on your device encompasses a wide range of HD pictures and is as challenging and attractive as real puzzles. If you are excited about playing puzzle games, you will definitely love our Jigsaw Puzzles for adults!\r\n\r\nBeing a stress relieving and relaxing game, daily jigsaw puzzles for adults will help you to take a break and get rid of the everyday routine.\r\n\r\nDiscover the colorful world of jigsaw puzzles for free!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Tons of jigsaw puzzles for free with beautiful, high quality pictures. Choose from a variety of categories such as Colors, Flowers, Nature, Animals, Art, Landmarks, Hard picture puzzles and others\r\n\u2022 Daily free puzzle games. Get a new HD jigsaw puzzle every day and try to solve it\r\n\u2022 Coins for exclusive content. Get coins by completing HD jigsaw puzzles. Spend them to get exclusive puzzles and collections!\r\n\u2022 Mystery puzzles. Challenge yourself to reveal what is hidden in a picture\r\n\u2022 Daily updated gallery. You\u2019ll never run out of free puzzles in our jigsaw box\r\n\u2022 Helpful hints. Use Hint to match the next piece to the picture puzzle if you are stuck\r\n\u2022 From 36 to 400 puzzle pieces. The more pieces, the harder your jigsaw puzzle games become\r\n\u2022 Rotation mode. Turn on rotation, make the free jigsaw puzzle game more tricky!\r\n\u2022 Custom backgrounds. Choose your favourite appearance to solve free jigsaw puzzle games with more pleasure.\r\n\r\nMake every day relaxing and entertaining putting jigsaw puzzle pieces together! Enjoy our free puzzle games!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use:\r\nhttps://easybrain.com/terms\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://easybrain.com/privacy",
